0800a9de <scrollbar_init_draw_dsc>:
 * @param obj pointer to an object
 * @param dsc the draw descriptor to initialize
 * @return LV_RESULT_OK: the scrollbar is visible; LV_RESULT_INVALID: the scrollbar is not visible
 */
